flowchart TD
    Start([Requirement & Scope Definition]) --> IdentifyRisks[Identify Operational & Security Risks]
    IdentifyRisks --> RankRisks["Rank Risks: Likelihood × Impact Ordinal Score"]
    
    RankRisks --> R1["Risk 1: Duplicate Sensor Events (4×4=16)"]
    RankRisks --> R2["Risk 2: Overlapping Booking Accepted (3×5=15)"]
    RankRisks --> R3["Risk 3: Unauthorized Restricted Approval (3×5=15)"]
    RankRisks --> R4["Risk 4: Incorrect Threshold or SLA Boundary (3×4=12)"]
    RankRisks --> R5["Risk 5: UI Starts but API Fails (3×4=12)"]
    RankRisks --> R6["Risk 6: Migration Loses History (2×5=10)"]

    R1 --> Mitigate[Define Automated Quality Gates & Oracles]
    R2 --> Mitigate
    R3 --> Mitigate
    R4 --> Mitigate
    R5 --> Mitigate
    R6 --> Mitigate

    Mitigate --> LayeredTests[Execute Unit, Integration, Regression Tests]
    LayeredTests --> Decision{All Gates Pass?}
    Decision -- Yes --> ReleaseAccepted([Release Approved for Staging/Production])
    Decision -- No --> BlockRelease([Release Blocked: Halt Delivery & Revert])
